# DramaWay UI

Read `docs/design/system.md` before building a section, and `docs/design/figma-baseline.md` for any measured value. Do not call the Figma MCP for numbers that are already in those files.

The Figma file is a visual direction, not a spec: no auto-layout, no variables, no components, no mobile screens. Deviations from it are deliberate and listed in `system.md` — do not "fix" them back.

## Hard rules

- **No pixel values in `components/sections/*`.** Use tokens or the composition classes. Missing something? Add a class in `@layer components` in `globals.css` — never an arbitrary value like `mt-[137px]`.
- **Decorative circles are backgrounds, not elements.** The Figma dot band is 270 identical circles; `DotBand` draws it with `radial-gradient`.
- **Every section survives empty data.** Sanity fields are optional and galleries vary in length; Figma always shows a fixed count.
- **Headings are uppercase** via `@layer base` on `h1–h4`, except `.hero-title` (sentence case on **every** inner-page H1 hero and the homepage), `.pub-cat-head` (Czytelnia category titles: Alexandria Light magenta), `.history-title` (`/fundacja` timeline: Alexandria SemiBold), and `.team-bio-name` (`/fundacja` team: Alexandria, no uppercase). Do not add `uppercase` on each heading, and do not store ALL CAPS in CMS copy.
- **Chrome copy (CTA, hero/section leads, list headings) lives in `lib/homepage-copy.ts` and `lib/subpage-copy.ts`.** Those files are fallbacks when the matching CMS field is empty. `/fundacja` chrome can also live on the `aboutPage` singleton. Do not hardcode new Polish UI strings in JSX. A new string is a quote from the Figma frame, or a row in the copy-exceptions table in `docs/design/system.md`. Do not invent synonyms (e.g. „relacje” for „edycje”). Drupal body/summary is not Figma copy — do not rewrite articles to match the file.

## What exists

Classes: `.page`, `.split` / `.split-text` / `.split-media` / `.split-reverse`, `.hero` / `.hero-title` / `.hero-heading` / `.hero-copy` / `.hero-media` / `.hero-stack`, `.site-header` / `.site-nav-overlay`, `.cols-3`, `.stack` / `.stack-item` / `.stack-narrow` / `.stack-wide`, `.measure`, `.gallery-lead` / `.gallery-lead-row`, `.team-row` / `.team-photo`, `.values-row` / `.values-item` / `.values-label`, `.history-list` / `.history-item` / `.history-marker` / `.history-title`, `.document-list`, `.team-bios` / `.team-bio` / `.team-bio-name` / `.team-bio-blurb`, `.body-figure` / `.body-figure-small` / `-medium` / `-wide` + `.body-image`, `.portable-body`, `.filter-row-switches`, `.pub-cat`.

Components: `layout/section.tsx`, `visual/dot-band.tsx`, `visual/palette-row.tsx`, `visual/blob.tsx`, `visual/cta-link.tsx`, `visual/media.tsx`. Inner pages: `PageHero` (default split + circle as `/`; `data-split-hero` overlays the header at `lg+` without hiding `.subpage-palette`; `layout="stack"` is text-only — no photo, overlay, or DotBand; optional `body` is Portable Text in the copy column), `BlobRow` (`width`: `page` default / `narrow` / `wide`; `density="compact"` stays two-up on `.page`; `BlobStack` is the inner list), `FilterRow` (Czytelnia format CTAs; omit empty drawers; hide the row when fewer than two remain), `PublicationCategoryList` (category sections, default open, hover collapse), `LeadGallery` (1 landscape + 3 portrait), `TeamRow` (circle portraits), `/fundacja`: `FundacjaValues` (tangent circles, label inside), `TeamBios`, `FundacjaHistory` (omit when empty), `FundacjaDocuments`. Copy for inner heroes: `lib/subpage-copy.ts` (fallbacks); `/fundacja` also reads singleton `aboutPage`.

Tokens: colours `sand` `ink` `green` `green-ink` `magenta` `navy` `brand-1…7`; fonts `font-display` `font-body`; sizes `text-display`/`text-h1` 48, `text-h2` 32 (band labels), `text-h3` 24 (section titles), `text-h4` 20 (card titles), `text-lead` 20 (hero + prose), `text-body` 18, `text-small` 14; rhythm `py-section`; `--content-narrow` / `--content-wide` / `--hero-media-max` / `--values-size` / `--history-marker` / `--body-image-small` / `--body-image-wide` / `--body-image-max`. Size class ≠ HTML tag: one H1, H2 per section, H3 for news cards.

```tsx
// BAD — hardcoded geometry, raw Figma green, no empty-state
<div style={{ marginLeft: 156 }}>
  <a className="text-[#369125]">poznaj nasze projekty</a>
  <img src={url} width={481} height={823} />
</div>

// GOOD
<Section bleed>
  <div className="split">
    <div className="split-text py-section">
      <h2 className="font-display text-h3 font-black">{title}</h2>
      {summary ? <p className="measure mt-8 text-body">{summary}</p> : null}
      {ctaLabel ? <CtaLink href={ctaHref}>{ctaLabel}</CtaLink> : null}
    </div>
    <Media image={image} alt={alt} variant="bleed" className="split-media" />
  </div>
</Section>
```
